OL,3,GNEWSAHospital 'used model skeleton' for
OL,4,Apatient's drip
OL,5,
OL,6,FA woman with suspected meningitis was
OL,7,Fplaced in an A&E corridor for 19 hours
OL,8,Fand put on a drip propped up by a model
OL,9,Fskeleton, her mother has said.
OL,11,FAlexandra Leat said her 28-year-old
OL,12,Fdaughter Cleo Rawlings had spent her
OL,13,Fbirthday on Thursday with a severe
OL,14,Fheadache in Salisbury District
OL,15,FHospital, which was "full to capacity"
OL,16,Fand "every bed was taken".
OL,18,FRawlings' drip was held up by a medical
OL,19,Ftraining skeleton, while other
OL,20,Fpatients' drips were hanging from
OL,21,Fpicture frames, said Leat.
OL,23,APub: 04-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
