OL,3,GNEWSAHospital 'used model skeleton' for
OL,4,Apatient's drip
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe hospital said it "sincerely
OL,7,Fapologised" the teaching skeleton was
OL,8,Fnot removed from the drip stand before
OL,9,Fits use, which "fell below standards we
OL,10,Fexpect". It added staff were working
OL,11,Funder "sustained pressure".
